n exchange for removing one Failure."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Success and Failure"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Success:"]}," The heroes reach the location they seek without being captured or triggering an alarm.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Failure:"]}," The heroes reach their destination but are confronted by guards, and alarms sound throughout the facility.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
